    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya chifo cha Jehoramu, enyezi a Jerusalemu amuhenda Ahaziya, mwana mdide wa mfalume atawale badalaye. Ana avyere a mfalume kala akaolagbwa ni vikosi vyokpwedza phamwenga na Aarabu kuchita kambi. Kpwa hivyo Ahaziya mwana wa mfalume Jehoramu wa Juda achitawala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaziya kala ana miaka mirongo miiri na miiri ariphoandza kutawala. Naye watawala kpwa muda wa mwaka mmwenga ko Jerusalemu. Nine kala aihwa Athalia, mdzukulu wa Omuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyu naye walunga njira za nyumba ya Ahabu kpwa mana kala anashauriwa ni nine ahende mai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahenda garigo mai mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu dza arivyohenda Ahabu. Ise wa Ahaziya ariphofwa, atu a nyumba ya Ahabu ndio okala ashaurie nao achimuangamiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaziya walunga sana mashauri gao hata achiphiya na Joramu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Joramu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chieburania piya nkuihwa Jehoramu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mwana wa Ahabu mfalume wa Iziraeli kpwendapigana na Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu ko Ramothi-Giliadi. Nyo Aaramu achimlumiza Joramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Joramu wauya Jeziriili ili akararise maronda arigogaphaha hiko Rama,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ramothi yiihwa Rama kpwa Chieburania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " arikopigana na Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu. Ndipho Ahaziya mwana wa Jehoramu mfalume wa Juda achitserera achendamjambosa Joramu mwana wa Ahabu ko Jeziriili kpwa mana kala akalumizwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu kala akakusudiya kukala Ahaziya andaolagbwa hiko ndiko kpwendamjambosa Joramu. Ariphofika hiko, iye na Joramu akpwendakutana na Jehu mwana wa Nimushi ambaye kala akatsambulwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu aangamize nyumba yosi ya Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jehu ariphokala anatimiza uamuli wa Mlungu kpwa nyumba ya Ahabu, waphaha akulu a Juda na ana alume a nduguze Ahaziya ambao kala anamuhumikira Ahaziya, achiaolaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu a Jehu amuendza Ahaziya achendamgbwira hiko Samariya ambako kala akadzifwitsa, achimreha kpwa Jehu naye achimuolaga. Ahaziya wazikpwa kpwa mana atu aamba, “Hiyu ni mdzukulu wa Jehoshafati ambaye wamuendza Mwenyezi Mlungu na moyowe wosi.” Nyumba ya Ahaziya kala taina mutu yeweza kutawala hinyo ufalume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Athalia nine wa Ahaziya ariphoona mwanawe akafwa, waunuka achiolaga atu osi a chivyazi cha chifalume cha nyumba ya Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jehosheba, mwana wa chichetu wa mfalume Jehoramu, ndugungbwa mchetu wa Ahaziya, wamuhala Joashi mwana wa Ahaziya chisiri-siri, kula kahi ya ana a mfalume ariokala analondwa aolagbwe. Wamuhala iye phamwenga na mreziwe achiatiya chumba cha kulala. Phahi Jehosheba mwana mchetu wa mfalume Jehoramu, ambaye piya kala ni mkpwaza mlavyadzi-sadaka Jehoyada, achimfwitsa Joashi, ili asionewe ni Athalia. Jehosheba kala ni ndugu mchetu wa Ahaziya. Kpwa hivyo Athalia kamuolagire Joashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joashi wafwitswa ndani ya Nyumba ya Mlungu kpwa muda wa miaka sita, wakati Athalia ariphokala anatawala yo tsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
